@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-73 - Reply to Customer Chat

actor "Admin" as Actor
boundary "Chat Widget / Admin Chat UI" as FE
control "ChatController" as API
control "ChatService" as Service
database "MongoDB: chatConversations" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-73
FE -> API: POST /chat/conversations/:id/messages
API -> Service: Execute Reply to Customer Chat
Service -> DB: Read/write chatConversations
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Tin nhắn reply được gửi

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Conversation đang mở
Post: Tin nhắn reply được gửi
Main flow:
1. Admin nhập reply
2. Admin bấm Send
3. System gọi API POST /chat/conversations/:id/messages { senderType:\nmanager, text }
4. System push message, tăng unread cho user
5. Customer thấy reply trong widget
end note
@enduml
